# The rule scatter is derived from a snapshot's rule-partition.csv and is
# regenerated exactly by `bin/euthyna plot <snapshot>`. Snapshots keep what was
# *measured*; a 100 KB rendering of it per snapshot is not that, and it would
# be the largest thing in this directory within a dozen runs.
data/snapshots/*/rules.html

# Python bytecode from analysis/ imports.
__pycache__/
